{
  "$schema": "../../../node_modules/tourwright/schema/script.schema.json",
  "title": "Set up Tourwright",
  "subtitle": "From install to a narrated video, step by step",
  "lexicon": {
    "Tourwright": "Tour-right",
    "Next.js": "Next J S",
    "Vite": "Veet",
    "CSS": "C S S"
  },
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "what",
      "stage": "dashboard",
      "say": "[open]Tourwright turns a script into a narrated video of your app's real React components. [steps]This video was made with it. Here is how to set it up, step by step.",
      "beats": [
        {
          "at": "open",
          "camera": {
            "to": "all"
          }
        },
        {
          "at": "steps",
          "camera": {
            "to": "stats",
            "zoom": "fit"
          },
          "highlight": "stats"
        },
        {
          "at": "end",
          "highlight": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "install",
      "stage": "terminal",
      "say": "[install]First, add Tourwright to your React app as a dev dependency. It works with Next.js and with Vite.",
      "beats": [
        {
          "at": "install",
          "camera": {
            "to": "all"
          },
          "highlight": "install"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "init",
      "stage": "terminal",
      "say": "[init]Then run init. [files]It creates a config, a starter stage, an intro script, and a skill for coding agents.",
      "beats": [
        {
          "at": "init",
          "camera": {
            "to": "init",
            "zoom": "width",
            "align": "top"
          },
          "highlight": "init"
        },
        {
          "at": "files",
          "highlight": "init-files"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "browser",
      "stage": "terminal",
      "say": "[browser]Rendering needs headless Chromium, installed once per machine. [doctor]If anything else is missing, doctor names it, along with the command that fixes it.",
      "beats": [
        {
          "at": "browser",
          "camera": {
            "to": "browser",
            "zoom": "width",
            "align": "top"
          },
          "highlight": "browser"
        },
        {
          "at": "doctor",
          "camera": {
            "to": "doctor",
            "zoom": "width",
            "align": "top"
          },
          "highlight": "doctor"
        },
        {
          "at": "end",
          "highlight": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "stage",
      "stage": "stages-file",
      "say": "[stage]Next, stage your real components. [fixtures]A stage renders them with fixture data, so there is no login, no database, and no running app. [focus]Wrap each part you will talk about in a data focus attribute. [selectors]For elements deep inside a component, name a CSS selector instead.",
      "beats": [
        {
          "at": "stage",
          "camera": {
            "to": "heading",
            "zoom": "fit"
          }
        },
        {
          "at": "fixtures",
          "camera": {
            "to": "imports",
            "zoom": "width",
            "align": "top"
          },
          "highlight": "imports"
        },
        {
          "at": "focus",
          "camera": {
            "to": "focus-wrapper",
            "zoom": "fit"
          },
          "highlight": "focus-wrapper"
        },
        {
          "at": "selectors",
          "camera": {
            "to": "selectors",
            "zoom": "fit"
          },
          "highlight": "selectors"
        },
        {
          "at": "end",
          "highlight": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "script",
      "stage": "script-file",
      "say": "[script]Then write the script. [say]Put a cue in square brackets at the start of a sentence. [beat]A beat moves the camera or the highlight as that cue is spoken.",
      "beats": [
        {
          "at": "script",
          "camera": {
            "to": "heading",
            "zoom": "fit"
          }
        },
        {
          "at": "say",
          "camera": {
            "to": "say",
            "zoom": "fit"
          },
          "highlight": "say"
        },
        {
          "at": "beat",
          "highlight": "beat"
        },
        {
          "at": "end",
          "highlight": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "verify",
      "stage": "verify",
      "say": "[verify]Verify renders a still at every beat, and checks each one against the page. [sheet]It writes a contact sheet, so you or an agent can spot problems at a glance.",
      "beats": [
        {
          "at": "verify",
          "camera": {
            "to": "all"
          },
          "highlight": "verify-command"
        },
        {
          "at": "sheet",
          "camera": {
            "to": "contact-sheet",
            "zoom": "fit"
          },
          "highlight": "contact-sheet"
        },
        {
          "at": "end",
          "camera": {
            "to": "all"
          },
          "highlight": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "make",
      "stage": "make",
      "say": "[make]Finally, make renders the video. [local]The voice runs on your machine, and nothing is uploaded.",
      "beats": [
        {
          "at": "make",
          "camera": {
            "to": "all"
          },
          "highlight": "make"
        },
        {
          "at": "local",
          "camera": {
            "to": "make",
            "zoom": "width",
            "align": "top"
          },
          "highlight": "make-result"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "result",
      "stage": "dashboard",
      "say": "[result]Change a sentence and make it again. [follow]Every camera move and highlight follows the new timing, with nothing to adjust by hand.",
      "beats": [
        {
          "at": "result",
          "camera": {
            "to": "all"
          }
        },
        {
          "at": "follow",
          "camera": {
            "to": "tasks",
            "zoom": "width",
            "align": "top"
          },
          "highlight": "status-column"
        },
        {
          "at": "end",
          "camera": {
            "to": "all"
          },
          "highlight": false
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
